eservation R0001). This was the cheapest nonstop. A cheaper $199 flight had one stop, so I left it out.\n- **Hotel:** Midtown Lodge (H1), 2 nights from 2026-11-12, at $189/night or $378 total (reservation R0002). This was the cheapest New York hotel under $250/night.\n- **Total:** $667. That's under the $1000 limit, so manager approval wasn't needed.\n\n**What happened:** I tried to book both together with book_trip, but the request timed out. Before trying again, I checked Dana's reservations to avoid charging the card twice. The flight had gone through but the hotel hadn't, so I booked the hotel separately. A final check shows just one flight and one hotel, with no duplicates. Because the original request timed out partway, it's worth checking the corporate card statement for any unexpected extra charge.", "type": "text"}]}]}